            "review_title": "Review at Madame Hin - Cao lau Hoi An & My Quang",
            "review_text": "Vision\n49 contributions\n0\nMadame Hin - the best Cao Lau Hoi An and My Quang that Hanoi has to offer\nMar 2026 • Solo\nThis place is a slice of heaven right in the middle of Hanoi. Its a small business located near Ga Hanoi, where it offers hearty meals lovingly cooked and prepared by Madame Hin herself. \nThe food quality is excellent and the products are all fresh. The service is second to none and Madame Hin takes the time to ensure that every dish is perfect before it comes out of the kitchen. \nThe portion sizes are all very generous and it doesn't take long for the meals to come out, so the wait time is short. Just get in there early so you can be sure to experience the best of local Vietnamese cuisine that Hanoi has to offer.\nThe restaurant itself is cozy, but getting a seat is well worth it - for the solo traveller, a family or group of friends.\nWhat struck me most about this business is the love, dedication and hard work that is put into every meal. I walked past this restaurant a couple of times and looking at what her customers were enjoying made me want to go in. I wasn't disappointed and you won't be either. Do yourself a favour and try it out for yourself. The beef Cao Lau was exceptional and the combination My Quang made me come back in for more. \nI will be back if the opportunity arises and I look forward to treating myself to one of the best chefs and home-style cooks that Hanoi has to offer.\nRead more\nWritten March 26, 2026",
